    "reducedMotion": "Source CSS code review: source/css/00sc_9lpb3zcn.css disables .hero-reveal, .hero-star, .feature-orb, and .divider-shine animations under prefers-reduced-motion:reduce. Adapter uses the same media query to skip petals/envelope transitions, reveal hidden nodes at opacity 1 with no transform, stop parallax, scroll instantly, and set gift modal transition duration to 0ms. Browser media override unavailable; package qaReducedMotion=1 preview verified no petals and immediate opening.",
    "browserFidelity": "Matched source and app browser review at 1280x720 covered opening, parallax bridge, detail date/name layout, preview-only source gallery and venue media, empty creator/public photo-slot hiding, gift modal, and footer. Gallery-1 through gallery-6 archive/package hashes are identical and recorded under sourcePreviewMedia; the canonical sample maps gallery-2, 1, 3, 6, 4, 5 in source order. Catalog poster preview.webp is an actual 450x800 opening capture. Follow-up with the archived compiled module confirmed full-width 720px internal scrollers, source reveal thresholds/durations/staggers, 12 opening petals, and To'yona panel/card geometry after removing an empty receipt-host flex gap. Different demo fixture content explains total page-height differences. Date binding preserves the source ampersand/time-label rows and date separators; source footer attribution is retained.",
